<title>PERU: Peru fishing sell-offs seen raising $65 million.</title>
<headline>Peru fishing sell-offs seen raising $65 million.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The remaining sell-offs of assets belonging to Peru's state fishing company Pescaperu should raise about $65 million, government daily El Peruano said Monday.</p>
<p>The newspaper quoted Dante Matellini Burga, head of Pescaperu's privatization committee, as saying the outstanding privatization of 13 factories and four refineries would be finished by February of next year.</p>
<p>-- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134</p>
</text>
